a-na 9 ma-na KÙ.BABBAR ša É ḫa-ar-ta ù 10 ma-na KÙ.BABBAR ša ḫa-al-ki-a-šu ù kà-ri-a me-er-ú da-la-áš a-na ša-lim-a-šùr ù me-er-e-šu ú-lá i-tù-ru,"Regarding the 9 minas of silver from Harta's house and the 10 minas of silver from Halkiaššu and Karriya, the sons of Dalaš, they shall not claim against Šalim-Aššur and his sons."
