0.5 GÍN KÙ.BABBAR a-na a-lim(ki) ša-ak-šu-dí wa-ar-ki-a qá-bí-a-tí,You have been ordered to forward 0.5 shekels of silver to the City after my departure.
šu-ma wa-ar-ki-tí a-na a-lim(ki) lá tù-ša-ak-ší-dí 1 ma-na-um 0.66666 ma-na i-na a-lim(ki) ta-ša-qá-lam,"If after my departure you do not forward it to the City, you will pay 0.66666 mina per mina in the City."
a-ḫi a-ta KÙ.BABBAR a-na É-a-ba-áš-tí šu-qú-ul-ma wa-ar-ki-tí a-na a-lim(ki) ša-ak-ší-dí lu-mu-un li-bi₄-im a-ra-ší-a-ku-um,"Please, my brother, pay the silver to Ea-bāštī and forward it to the City after me, lest I get angry with you."
a-wa-tim ša ta-ta-wu-ni la-ší-na-ma KÙ.BABBAR a-na É-a-ba-áš-tí šu-qú-ul-ma lu at-ḫu-a-ni,The words you spoke are improper; pay the silver to Ea-bāštī and let us be brothers.
