ṭup-pu-šu a-na a-bi₄-kà e-zi-ib,He left his tablet for your father.
ù a-na-ku 1 ma-na 10 GÍN KÙ.BABBAR ḫa-bu-lá-ak-šu-um,"Also, I personally owe him 1 mina 10 shekels of silver."
