a-ma-kam a-ni-na URUDU ú ṣí-ba-sú li-iš-qú-lá-kum-ma,Have Annina pay you the copper and its accrued interest there.
i-na (d)UTU-ši ṭup-pì ta-ša-me-ú tí-ib-a-ma a-tal-kam ù lu ni-iz-ku,The very day you hear my letter you should set out and come and then let us settle accounts.
2 ma-na 8 GÍN KÙ.BABBAR e-lá-ma ù ša-lim-a-ḫu-um,"2 minas 8 shekels of silver (of) Elamma and Šalim-ahum,"
0.5 ma-na 3.5 GÍN e-lá-ma i-na ILLAT id-na-a,"93.5 shekels (of silver) of Elamma from the caravan of Idnaya,"
ì-lí-a-lim ù a-šùr-i-dí i-na É.GAL-lim na-ad-ú,Ilī-ālum and Aššur-idī have deposited in the palace.
