15.25 GÍN e-lá-ma i-na ILLAT a-la-ḫi-im ù bu-zi-a a-dí-im,15 1/4 shekels Elamma has as share in the caravan of Ali-ahum and Buṣiya.
2 ma-na 8 sa e-lá-ma i-na ILLAT a-zu-za ù a-šùr-iš-t␀í-kāl a-dí-im,2 minas 8 shekels Elamma has as share in the caravan of Azuza and Iliš-tikal.
