me-eḫ-ra-tim KÙ.BABBAR i-na ra-mì-ni-kà dí-in-ma,"give the corresponding amount in silver yourself,"
iš-tí ṣú-ḫa-ri-a ku-nu-ki-kà šé-bi-lam,and send it with my servants under your seal.
