a-na a-lu-lā-a ki-ma DAM.GÀR šu-qú-ul,"pay it to Alulaya on behalf of the merchant."""
15 u₄-me lá i-li-ik KÙ.BABBAR im-qú-ta-ma,"Before 15 days had gone by silver fell into my hands,"
a-lu-lá-a a-na-kam lá-šu-ma,"but Alulaya was not here,"
