a-dí ší-ni-šu ú 3 šál-ší-šu tí-ir-tí i-li-kà-kum,"2 or 3 times I have sent word to you,"
ú i pí-a tí-ra-tim áš-ta-pá-ra-kum,"and I have sent you oral messages,"
ta-áš-pu-ra-am um-ma a-ta-ma KÙ.BABBAR iš-tí-kà-ma li-bí₄-ší,"and you answered: ""Let the silver remain in your possession."""
li-ba-kà lu i-de₈ ki-ma iš-tù 4 ITU.KAM KÙ.BABBAR a šu-mì-kà kà-ṣú-du,You certainly know that the silver has been held up for 4 months in your name.
u₄-ra-ni a-ta-lá-ak,Tomorrow I shall leave.
