a-na en-um-a-šur qí-bí-ma um-ma a-mur-IŠTAR-ma,To Ennam-Aššur from Amur-Ištar:
a-na-kam ... a-na ša-lá-tù-wa-ar a-li-kum kà-lá,Here (...) the traveling party has been stopped on the way to Šalatuwar.
i-na wa-aḫ-šu-ša-na wa-áš-ba-ku,I am staying in Wahšušana.
a-dí a-wa-tum ša ša-lá-tù-wa-ar i-za-ku-a-ni,"Until the matter of Šalatuwar has been cleared up,"
wa-ša-na-lam a-na ša-lá-tù-wa-ar wa-ṣí,Wašanalam has left for Šalatuwar.
tí-ir-ta-kà li-li-kam-ma a-šar ma-lá-ki-im mì-il₅-kà-ni,Send me word and decide what there is to decide for me.
šu-ma a-wa-tum i-za-ku-wa a-na ma-lá tí-ir-tí-kà e-ra-áb,"If the matter is cleared up, I shall enter in accordance with your instructions."
ŠU.NÍGIN KÙ.BABBAR-pì-kà 15 ma-na 10 GÍN lu ša AN.NA ú ṣú-ba-tí-kà ku-nu-ki-ni ṣí-li-a na-áš-a-ku-um,"Total of your silver: 15 minas 10 shekels, Șilliya brings you under our seal - both that from the tin and that from your textiles."
i-na ba-áb ha-ra-ni-šu ša e-lá-ma um-ma pí-lá-ah-a-šùr-ma a-na e-lá-ma-ma,When Elamma was about to set out on a journey Pilah-Aššur said to Elamma:
lá-qé-ep DUMU i-li-a ku-nu-im AN.NA a-na 70 ha-am-ša-tim ú-kà-lam,"""Lā-qēp, the son of Iliya, who belongs to you(r firm), offers me tin with a credit term of 70 weeks."""
um-ma e-lá-ma-ma i-a-am AN.NA-ki le-qé-ma gi₅-im-lá-ni a-na 20 ha-am-ša-tim 8 GÍN.TA lá ta-ba-ta-qám,"Elamma answered: ""Take my own tin and do me a favor by giving me (for it) not less than 8 shekels per (shekel of silver) in 20 weeks."""
