ki-ma KÙ.BABBAR ta-ša-qá-lá-ni a-šar ša-pár-tum kà-an-ku ku-nu-ki ma-nu-ki-ì-lí-a lu-dí-ma,"When you pay the silver, let him identify Mannum-kī-iliya's seal where the security is sealed."
ù tuppu-am ša 3 ma-na KÙ.BABBAR ú çí-ba-tí-šu šé-çí-a-ma,And take out the tablet for the 3 minas of silver and its interest.
tuppu-am šu-a-tí ú sí-kà-LUGAL ku-un-kà-ma a-na IŠTAR-lá-ma-sí pí-iq-da,Seal this tablet and the sikkanu-stone and entrust them to Ištar-lamassī.
ú i-ša-qá-al KÙ.BABBAR ki-ma ša-áp-tum i-a-tù-ni ší-be šu-uk-na,"Also, when the silver is paid, set witnesses to prove that the wool is mine."
ù ša-áp-tám a-na ša-lim-wa-ar-dí ù ma-nu-ki-ì-lí-a sà-ni-qá-ma ma-lá ša-áp-tám i-za-ku-a-ni ší-bé-e šu-uk-na-šu-nu-tí,"Also, check the wool for Šalim-wardī and Mannum-kī-iliya, and set witnesses for them about how much wool is cleared."
ki-ma ša-áp-tum ú 7 ANŠE.HI.A ša en-um-a-šur ša-áp-tám kà-ni-kà-ma ku-nu-ki-ku-nu iš-tí lu-qú-tí-a-ma pí-iq-da-ma li-ir-dí-ú-nim,"Seal the wool, (stating that) the wool and 7 donkeys belong to Ennam-Aššur, and entrust it under your seals with my other goods so they may conduct it here."
a ma-lá a-na-kam ša-lim-ar-dí nu-na-hi-du-ni le-pu-uš-šu-nu-tí,Let them do for them what we instructed Šalim-wardī here.
en-um-a-šur a-lá-hu-um i-ša-al,Ennam-Aššur questioned Ali-ahum.
um-ma en-um-a-šur-ma a-na a-lá-hi-im-ma,Thus said Ennam-Aššur to Ali-ahum.
e-ni-ma-ma na-áš-pé-er-tum ku-nu-ki-kà IGI 3 ší-be ú-kà-lim-kà-ma tù-kà-i-ni-ma šu-nu-tí-ma ni-ip-qí-sú,"Now here I have shown you the missive sealed by you in front of 3 witnesses, and you have confirmed it and we have entrusted it to them."
a-ma a-we-lu a-ni-ú-tum li-iš-me-ú,"Now, may these men listen."
a-ma ta-ah-sí-sá-tù-ni ku-nu-ku-ú-a ú ku-nu-ku-kà i-ki-ir ú-lá kà-i-in ša ni-kà-sí a-na-ku ú a-ta ni-sí-ú-ma ni-iz-ku-ú,"Confirm or deny our memorandum with my seal and your seal, concerning which you and I settled accounts and were cleared."
lá tù-na-ha-ni,Do not obstruct me!
a-lá-hu-um en-um-a-šur e-pu-ul,Ali-ahum answered Ennam-Aššur.
um-ma a-lá-hu-um-ma,Thus said Ali-ahum.
ta-ah-sí-sá-tum ku-nu-ku-kà ú ku-nu-ku-ú-a,They are the memoranda with your seal and my seal.
ba-am 3 lu ni-iç-ba-at-ma a ma-lá ta-ah-sí-sá-tim ša i-na ku-nu-ki-ni kà-an-kà-ni lu ni-iz-ku,"Come on, let us seize three men and let us settle in accordance with the memoranda that are sealed with our seals."
ma-lá KÙ.BABBAR a-bu-ni i li-bi-a ú i li-bi₄-kà i-dí-ú-ma,As much silver as our father set down as owed by me and by you.
tuppu-am a-bu-ni e-zi-bu-ma tuppu-am um-me-a-nu a-bi-ni ú-kà-i-lu-ni-ma,And concerning which our father left a tablet and our father's investors held the tablet.
i-na IGI kà-ri-im ça-hi-ir GAL i-šku-nu-šu-ma kà-ra-am a-na ra-bi₄-çí-im ip-qí-du-ni,"Which they deposited before the plenary assembly of the colony, and which the colony entrusted to an attorney."
ba-am u₄-ma-am ma-lá KÙ.BABBAR i-na tuppu-im lá-áp-ta-ni-ni lu nim-gu₅-ra-ma,"Come on, even today let us agree on how much silver we are booked for in that tablet."
a ma-lá dí-in a-lim(ki) KÙ.BABBAR lu ni-ik-nu-uk-ma a-na a-lim(ki) lu ni-li-ik,Let us seal the silver in accordance with the verdict of the City and let us go to the City.
10 GÍN KÙ.BABBAR ça-ru-pá-am i-ští i-ku-pí-a-šur DUMU PUZUR₄.IŠTAR,10 shekels of refined silver is owed by Ikūn-pī-Aššur son of Puzur-Ištar.
