a-na a-lá-hi-im qí-bi-ma um-ma SIG₅-pí-a-šur-ma,"To Ali-ahum speak, thus said Damiq-pī-Aššur."
a ma-lá na-áš-pé-er-tí-kà ša ta-dí-na-ni i-ša-ha-at a-ha-tí-kà ni-zi-iz-ma a-lam ni-im-hu-ur-ma,"In accordance with your missives that you gave me, we stood by your sister and confronted the City."
i-na DUB ša a-lim(ki) ša ni-il₅-qé-ú DUMU.MÍ šál-ma-a-šur ra-bi₄-ça-am ta-ça-ba-at-ma,"According to the tablet of the City that we received, Šalim-Aššur's daughter will take an attorney."
lu KÙ.BABBAR lu tuppu-ú lu tuppu-um ša šál-ma-a-šur i dur₄-hu-mì-it ša hu-bu-ul en-um-a-šur ú a-lá-hi-im ša um-me-a-nu a-na i-li-a ip-qí-du-ni,"Concerning the silver, the tablets, and the tablet of Šalim-Aššur in Durhumit regarding the debt of Ennam-Aššur and Ali-ahum, which the investors entrusted to Iliya."
ma-lá DUB šu-a-tí ša šál-ma-a-šur ú-lá-pí-tù en-um-a-šur ú a-lá-hi-im KÙ.BABBAR i-ša-qú-lu-ma a-na ra-bi₄-çí-im i-du-nu-ma KÙ.BABBAR a-na a-lim(ki) i-lá-ak,"In accordance with that tablet that Šalim-Aššur wrote, Ennam-Aššur and Ali-ahum must pay the silver and give it to the attorney, so the silver goes to the City."
a-ma me-eh-ra-at DUB ša-ni-im ú i ma-ah-ri-a-ma a-ba-ba ra-bi₄-ça-am ni-iç-ba-da-kum,"Now, copies of the second tablet exist and we have seized the attorney Ababa for you in my presence."
ša i-na ba-ri-ku-nu i-qá-bi₄-ú um-ma šu-ut-ma KÙ.BABBAR lá-áš-qú-ul i-na ša-ha-at ra-bi-çí-im i-za-az-ma ša lá iš-qú-lu ú-ša-áš-qal,"He among you who says ""I will pay the silver"" shall assist the attorney and make the one who did not pay pay."
ša ki-ma ku-a-tí ip-nu-ú-ni-ma um-ma šu-nu-ma a-wi-lu-um a-hu-kà KÙ.BABBAR a-na ig-ri ra-bi-çí-im šu-qú-ul,"Your representatives turned to me and said: ""The man is your colleague; pay the silver for the attorney's fee."""
a-dí-i a-wa-tum ku-a-tù-n,Since the matter is indeed yours.
15 ma-na KÙ.BABBAR ni-is-ha-sú DIRI ša-du-a-sú ša-bu,"15 minas of silver, its excise added, its transport fee paid."
