um-ma ša-lim-a-šùr-ma a-na šu-be-lim KÙ.BABBAR ša GÁN-lim a-na-ku pá-ḫu-ra-am qá-bi-a-ku,"Šalim-Aššur answered Šu-Bēlum: ""I have personally promised to collect the silver that is abroad."
mì-šum iš-tí DUMU da-da KÙ.BABBAR i ḫa-ḫi-im tal-qé,"Why have you taken silver from Dada's son in hahhum?"""
