ù en-na-sú-in iš-a-al-ma um-ma šu-ut-ma mì-šú-ú i tí-me-el-ki-a KÙ.BABBAR tal-qé,"So he asked Enna-Suen, saying: ""Why have you taken silver in Timel-kiya?"""
um-ma šu-ut-ma šu-ma al-qé a-da-gal-šu lá i-ba-ší,"He answered: ""I shall look whether I took any, but there is nothing."""
a-na a-wa-tim a-ni-a-tim kà-ru-um kà-ni-iš i-dí-ni-a-tí-ma IGI GÍR ša a-šùr ší-bu-tí-ni ni-dí-in,The Kanesh colony gave us for these proceedings and we gave our testimony before Aššur's dagger.
