a-na na-áb-sú-in en-um-a-šur ZU-re-i ú a-šur-iš-tí-kál qí-bi₄-ma um-ma iš-ma-a-šur-ma,"Say to Nab-Suen, Ennam-Aššur, Suen-rē'ī, and Aššur-ištikal, thus Išme-Aššur:"
áš-pu-ra-ku-nu-tí um-ma a-na-ku-ma DAM ḫa-lá-bi₄-im me-at,I wrote you as follows: 'The wife of hali-abum is dead.
mì-ma té-zi-bu pá-ḫi-ra-ma a-na ḫu-ur-ší-im iš-té-en šé-ri-ba-ma ki-ma i-a-tí ku-un-kà,Collect everything she left behind and bring it into one single storeroom and seal it in my name'.
áš-ta-na-me-ma ma-ma-na am-tám a-na a-ḫa-zi-im i-za-az,I hear by rumor that somebody intends to marry the maid.
ša-i-lá-ma lu DUMU a-šur lu nu-a-um ší-be-e šu-uk-na-šú-um,"Make inquiries and whether it is an Assyrian or an Anatolian, set witnesses against him."
lá e-ḫa-sí mì-ma té-zi-bu lu ba-áb-tám ṣa-bi₄-sí,"He shall not marry her! Seize everything she left behind, also outstanding claims."
a-ḫu-ú-a a-tù-nu i-iḫ-da x a-wi-lum KÙ.BABBAR ma-dam i-ta-ba-al,"Please, my brothers, take care, (for) the man may take along a lot of silver."
bu-lá-tí-a šar-ší-a-ni,"Make me obtain my assets!"""
a-na a-lá-ḫi-im DUMU šál-ma-a-šur KIŠIB MAN-a-šur DUMU a-šur-dan,To Ali-ahum son of Šalim-Aššur; seal of Puzur-Aššur son of Aššur-dan.
i-na-sú-in dan-a-šur e-pu-ul,Enna-Suen answered Dan-Aššur.
um-ma i-na-sú-in a-na dan-a-šur-ma me-er me-tim a-na-ku,Enna-Suen said to Dan-Aššur: I am an heir.
ṭup-pá-am tù-kà-li-mì-ma i-na ṭup-pì-im ša 12 ma-na KÙ.BABBAR ša tù-kà-li-mì-ni šu-mì a-bi₄-kà PÚZUR-a-šur ú-lá ú-du,"You have shown me a tablet and in the tablet concerning 12 minas of silver that you have shown me the name of your father Puzur-Aššur was not indicated,"
ú šu-mì ma-ma-na ú-lá ú-du-ú … lá tù-ba-a-ra-ni,nor was anybody's name indicated. You do not provide proof for me.
lu a-ni-a-ma me-er-e me-tim a-na-ku a-ḫe-e ma-du-tim i-šu-ú,May it be like this: I am the heir. I have many brothers.
ṭup-pá-am lu ni-il₅-qé-ma šu-ma a-bu-kà PÚZUR-a-šur i-ṣé-er i-dí-a-bi₄-im a-bi₄-a i-šu-ú,"Let us take the tablet and if your father Puzur-Aššur had any claim on my father Iddin-abum,"
