ší-tí KÙ.BABBAR-pì-im a-na DAM.GÀR-ri-a li-zi-iz,"The rest of the silver should stand available for my customers."""
a-na-kam a-šur-iš-tí-kál ú ì-lí-e-mu-qí ni-ṣa-na-ba-at-ma um-ma né-nu-ma 3.33333 ma-na KÙ.GI ša-lim-a-šur x x x x x,"We keep seizing Aššur-ištikal and Ilī-emūqī here, saying: ""Šalim-Aššur has invested 3.33333 minas of gold ..."""
a-na šu-ta-mu-zi e-lá-a a-šùr-ma-sú-wi ù en-um-a-šùr a-na a-šur-ma-sú-wi qí-bi₄-ma um-ma en-um-a-šùr-ma,"To Šu-Tammuzi, Elaya, Aššur-massuʾī and Ennam-Aššur; specifically to Aššur-massuʾī from Ennam-Aššur:"
a-na-kam a-dí 5-ší-šu ù iš-ri-šu ta-áp-nu-a-ma um-ma a-ta-ma a-ḫi a-ta i-na qá-tim e-ri-tim lá wa-áš-ba-ku-ma lá a-ḫa-li-iq,"Here you confronted me five or ten times, and you said: My dear brother, let me not stay with empty hands and perish!"
