ú ṣú-ha-ri-a na-hi-da-ma ú-ṭá-tám ú e-ṣí lu-pá-hi-ru-nim,"Also, instruct my servants to gather grain and firewood."
ú-ṭá-tám lu ŠE-am lu GIG ša ú-šé-ru-bu-ni-ni-ma a-na KÙ.BABBAR am-tum lu ta-ta-dí-in-ma,"The maid should sell for silver the grain, whether barley or wheat, that they bring in."
