ší-tí hu-sà-ri-im 13.33333 ma-na 9 GÍN iš-tí en-um-a-šùr i-ba-ší,"The rest of the lapis lazuli, 13 1/3 minas 9 shekels, is with Ennam-Aššur."
um-ma i-dí-sú-in-ma a-na ili₅-ba-ni a-bi-lá ù en-na-sú-in qí-bi₄-ma,"Thus Iddin-Suen says to Ilī-bāni, Abila and Enna(m)-Suen:"
i-na pá-na ú-nu-tí-a la-dí-a-am-ma,I wished to deposit my goods at the start.
mì-šu ú-nu-tí-a ta-at-ba-al-ma ni-kà-sí iš-tí-a ú-lá ta-sí,So why have you taken away my goods without having settled accounts with me?
ù u₄-ma-am lu-qú-tí x ta-ar-de₈-a-ma ku-nu-ke ša a-bi₄-a ù um-mì-a-ni-a ú-lá a-mu-ur,"And today you have taken along my merchandise, and I have not seen the seals of my father and my investor(s)."
ku-nu-ke tù-pá-ṭé-er-ma tu-BA-li-ih,You have broken these seals and you have desecrated them.
