7 ku-ta-ni a-šur-ma-lik DUMU i-na-a a-na 1 ma-na 13 GÍN KÙ.BABBAR il₅-qé,"Aššur-malik, son of Innāya, took 7 kutānu-textiles for 1 mina 13 shekels of silver."
1 ku-ta-nam i-tur₄-DINGIR il₅-qé,Itūr-ilum took 1 kutānu-textile.
