6 ku-ta-nu i-na li-bi₄ a-na-na,6 kutānu-textiles are with Anana.
2 ku-ta-ni ha-té-e nu-lá-bi-iš,We clothed the Hatte-men with 2 kutānu-textiles.
10 ku-ta-ni a-lu-úa ú-šé-ra-ba-am,Alua is bringing in 10 kutānu-textiles.
