ša 15 ma-na URUDU a šu-mì-a ú-ṣa-hi-ru,And they deducted that of 15 minas of copper for my account.
ší-tí KÙ.BABBAR-pì-šu 14 GÍN,The rest of his silver is 14 shekels.
