a-dí šu-ma a-a-e-ma pu-uz-ra-am i-ṣa-ba-at 1 ma-na KÙ.BABBAR ba-lu-um dí-nim ù ṣa-al-tim i-ša-qá-lam,"Until, if he takes refuge anywhere, he shall pay 1 mina of silver without lawsuit or litigation."
IGI a-zu-a IGI ra-áb-a-šur DUMU a-šur-i-mí-tí,"Witnessed by Azua, witnessed by Rab-Aššur son of Aššur-imittī."
