IGI šu-IŠTAR,Witnessed by Šu-Ištar.
a-na zu-ku-a qí-bi-ma um-ma PUZUR₄-a-šur-ma,"To Zukuwa say, thus Puzur-Aššur:"
šál-ma-ku,I am well.
i dur₄-ḫu-mì-it wa-áš-ba-ku,I stay in Durhumit.
i-na ḫu-ra-ma 1 ku-ta-nam i-ṣé-ri-a il₅-qé,He took 1 kutanam on my account in Hurama.
