a-ḫi a-ta we-da-ku,"My dear brother, I am alone."
mu-ša-ki-il₅ ANŠE ú ša ba-áb-tí ú-šé-ṣa-a-ni ú-lá i-šu,I have no one to feed the donkey or realise the outstanding claims.
