na-áb-ri-tum lá i-kà-ša-da-ni,Winter should not catch up with me.
a-na-kam ú-ku-ul-tí ANŠE.ḪI.A da-na-at,Here fodder for the donkeys is hard to get.
i-ḫi-id-ma ṣú-ḫa-ri ṭur₄-da-ma ku-ṣú-um lá i-kà-ša-da-ni,Take care to send me servants and the cold should not catch up with me.
ḫa-ra-ni le-pu-uš,Let me go on a trip.
i-na (d)UTU-ši ša ṭup-pí ta-ša-me-ú we-da-ku ṣú-ḫa-ri ṭur₄-da-am,"The very day you hear my letter - since I am alone, send the servants!"
i-na dur₄-ḫu-mì-it i-nu-mì a-bu-ni me-tù-ni ma-ṣa-ar-tám ku-nu-ki ša a-bi-ni a-lá-ḫu-um ip-té-ma,"In Durhumit, when our father died, Ali-ahum opened the strong-room sealed by our father,"
lu KÙ.BABBAR lu URUDU SIG₅ lu URUDU lá-mu-nam lu ḫu-sà-ra-am lu TÚG x lu ṭup-pí ḫa-ru-mu-tim ša DAM.GÀR IGI 3 DUMU um-me-a-ni ú-šé-ṣí-a-ma,"and witnessed by 3 affiliated traders he took out both silver, good copper, poor copper, lapis lazuli, textiles, and certified tablets concerning customers,"
a-na a-ni-na DUMU a-šur-be-el-a-wa-tim i-dí-ma,"and he gave it to Annina son of Aššur-bel-awātim,"
i-na wa-ar-ki-tim ṭup-pu-ú É a-ni-na,and later the tablets were in Annina's house.
