0.5 ma-na 4.5 GÍN KÙ.BABBAR a-na am-tim ni-iš-qú-ul,we paid 0.5 mina 4.5 shekels of silver to the maid.
ì-lí-áš-ra-ni ir-dí-a-kum,Ilī-ašrannī led it to you.
