6 GÍN KÙ.BABBAR a-šu-mì a-dí-da áš-qú-ul,I paid 6 shekels of silver in the name of Adida.
x GÍN ṭá-áb-tí áš-qú-ul,I paid x shekels for my salt-fee.
IGI PUZUR₄-a-šur DUMU a-šur-dan,"Witnessed by Puzur-Aššur, son of Aššur-dan."
šál-ma-a-šùr a-ṣé-er a-mur-IŠTAR ú-ṭá-hi-ú-ni-a-tí-ma um-ma šál-ma-a-šur-ma a-na a-mur-IŠTAR-ma mì-šu-um ší-im TÚG-ba-tí-a URUDU ta-aṣ-ba-at,"Šalim-Aššur made us approach Amur-Ištar, and Šalim-Aššur said to Amur-Ištar: ""Why have you seized the copper that was the proceeds from my textiles?"""
um-ma a-mur-IŠTAR-ma ke-na 4 GÚ lá-mu-nam aṣ-ba-at,"Amur-Ištar answered: ""Yes, I have seized 4 talents of poor copper."""
ba-lu-um hi-na-a ú ší-bé aṣ-ba-at,I seized it without hinnaya's permission and without witnesses.
um-ma ša-lim-a-šur-ma ha-bu-ra-ta-i-am tal-qé,"Šalim-Aššur said: ""Did you take copper from Haburat?"""
um-ma a-mur-IŠTAR-ma ša i qá-tim x-ta-šu-šu al-qé,"Amur-Ištar answered: ""I took what I could grab."""
um-ma a-mur-IŠTAR-ma a-ta lu-qú-tí ša 10 ma-na KÙ.BABBAR ta-aṣ-ba-at,"Amur Ištar continued: ""But did you not seize my merchandise worth 10 minas of silver?"""
um-ma ša-lim-a-šur mì-ma lá aṣ-ba-at-ma,"Šalim-Aššur answered: ""I have seized nothing."""
