IGI PUZUR₄-a-šur,Witnessed by Puzur-Aššur.
a-na en-na-nim a-šur-ba-ni ù a-lá-ḫi-im qí-bi-ma,"To Ennānum, Aššur-bāni and Ali-ahum speak:"
um-ma bé-lúm-ba-ni-ma,from Bēlum-bāni:
a-šu-mì AN.NA ša áš-pu-ra-ku-nu-tí-ni um-ma a-na-ku-ma,"Concerning the tin I wrote to you about, where I said:"
AN.NA a-na be-lá-nim dí-na-ma be-lá-nu-um lu-ub-lam,"Give the tin to Bēlānum and let Bēlānum bring it,"
a-na-kam be-lá-num ḫa-ra-šu iš-tí-ni,Bēlānum travels here together with us.
a-na šál-ma-a-šur dí-na-ma AN.NA ša-lim-a-šur lu-ub-lam,Give it to Šalim-Aššūr and let Šalim-Aššūr bring the tin.
a-šu-mì KÙ.BABBAR ša ša-zu-úz-tí a-lu-lá-a iš-qú-lá-ku-nu-tí-ni,Concerning the silver that Alulaya's representative paid to you -
KÙ.BABBAR lu a ḫu-bu-li-a ta-áš-qú-lá-ma ṭup-pá-am ḫa-ar-ma-am ša ku-nu-ki-a tù-šé-ṣí-a,what silver you have paid on my debt and recovered the certified tablet with my seal -
ṭup-pá-am li-it-a-ma šé-bi₄-lá-nim,split that tablet and send it to me.
ù a-na ší-tí KÙ.BABBAR tí-ir-ta-ak-nu li-li-kam,then send me word about the rest of the silver.
šu-ma šu-ku-ba-am KÙ.BABBAR tù-uš-ta-áš-qí-lá,"If you have made Šu-Kūbum pay silver,"
ší-ma-am ša ba-lá-ṭí-a ša-ma-ma šé-bi₄-lá-nim,then make a profitable purchase for me and send it to me.
a-xx lá a-šur-na-da x ma-na 5 GÍN KÙ.BABBAR na-bu-tám ù 10 ma-na URUDU ší-kam i-dí-nam,... Aššur-nādā ... 5 shekels of silver ... and he gave me 10 minas of copper.
ṣa-áb-ta-šu-ma 0.33333 ma-na 1 GÍN KÙ.BABBAR ša-áš-qí-lá-šu,Seize him and make him pay 0.3333 mina 1 shekel of silver.
ša-lim-a-šùr a-ṣé-er a-mur-IŠTAR ú-ṭá-ḫi-ni-a-tí-ma,"Šalim-Aššur made us approach Amur-Ištar,"
um-ma ša-lim-a-šùr-ma a-na a-mur-IŠTAR-ma,and Šalim-Aššur said to Amur-Ištar:
mì-šu-um ší-im ṣú-ba-tí-a URUDU ta-aṣ-ba-at,Why have you seized the copper that was the proceeds from my textiles?
um-ma a-mur-IŠTAR-ma,Amur-Ištar answered:
4 GÚ URUDU lá-mu-na-am ke-na aṣ-ba-at,"""Yes, I have seized 4 talents of poor copper."""
ba-lu-um ḫi-na-a ù ší-bi aṣ-ba-at,"""I seized it without hinnaya's permission and without witnesses."""
um-ma ša-lim-a-šùr-ma,Šalim-Aššur said:
ḫa-bu-ra-ta-i-a-am tal-qé,"""Did you take copper from haburat?"""
ša i-na qá-tim aḫ-ta-šu-šu al-qé,"""I took what I could grab."""
a-ta lu-qú-tí ša 10 ma-na KÙ.BABBAR lá ta-aṣ-ba-at,"""But did you not seize my merchandise worth 10 minas of silver?"""
um-ma ša-lim-a-šùr-ma,Šalim-Aššur answered:
mì-ma ú-lá aṣ-ba-at,"""I have seized nothing."""
um-ma a-mur-IŠTAR-ma,Amur-Ištar said:
