a-na ᅆu-bu-ul a-bi-šu-nu ki-la-la-šu-nu-ma i-za-zu,"Regarding their father's debt, both of them are responsible."
a-na q␀-bu-ur bu-zu-ur um-m␀-šu-nu a-na g␀m-ri-im ␀ ᅆu-bu-ul bu-zu-ur um-m␀-šu-nu i-d␀-IŠTAR-ma i-za-az,"Iddin-Ištar alone is responsible for the burial of their mother Puzur, for the expenses, and for the debt of their mother Puzur."
i-nu-m␀ ša i-na a-lim i-za-ku-␀-ni ␀-t␀ ša k␀-ni-iš l␀ i-ša-ku-nu,"When they are cleared in the City, they shall not place a claim on the house in Kanesh."
en-nam-a-š␀r a-l␀-ᅆa-am iš-a-al,Ennam-Aššur questioned Ali-ahum.
um-ma en-nam-a-šur-ma a-na a-l␀-ᅆi-im-ma,Ennam-Aššur said to Ali-ahum:
me-er-␀ me-tim n␀-nu,We are inheritors.
m␀-šu-um DAM.G␀R-ru a-bi-ni s␀-ki-ni ␀-k␀-lu,Why do our father's customers detain us?
ba-a-am a-na DAM.G␀R a-bi-ni lu nu-s␀-li-ma DAM.G␀R a-bi-ni lu nu-ᅡ␀-i-ib,"Come, let us plead with our father's customers and please our father's customers."
l␀ t␀-␀-na-a-ni ␀ s␀-ki-ni l␀ ␀-k␀-lu,Do not cheat me lest they detain us.
a-d␀ ᅆa-am-š␀-šu ␀ iš-ri-šu a-ᅆa-am eb-ra-am nu-š␀-š␀-ib-ma a-ta q␀-t␀m ta-am-ta-na-ᅆa-aᅣ ␀ t␀-␀-na-a-ni,"Five or ten times we have had a colleague and friend sit down to negotiate, but you have rejected everything; so, you cheat me."
iš-t␀-ma ša a-ᅆi-im ␀ eb-ri-im l␀ ta-ša-me-␀ ba-a a-na ᅣ␀-er 4 um-me-a-ni ša ki-ma a-bi-ni lu ni-li-ik-ma lu-š␀-š␀-ru-ni-a-t␀-ma,"Since you do not hear what brother and friend say, then come, let us go to the four investors who represent our father, let them set us straight."
DAM.G␀R-ri a-bi-ni lu nu-ᅡ␀-ib-ma ␀ a-na a-lim(ki) a-ᅣ␀-er a-ᅆa-t␀-ni gu₅-ba-␀b-tim lu ni-li-ik-ma a-na ma-l␀ š␀-ma-at a-bi-ni ša a-lim(ki) lu ni-iz-ku,"And let us please our father's customers, and let us go to the City to our sister, the priestess, and clear the matter in accordance with our father's will that is in the City."
l␀ t␀-na-ᅆa-ni ␀ K␀.BABBAR 1 G␀N l␀ t␀-ša-ag-ma-ra-ni,Do not obstruct me and do not let me waste a single shekel of silver.
l␀ ri-ig-ma-tum š␀-bu-tum,"This is not a formal court case, it is a statement before witnesses."
um-ma ᅆa-nu-nu li-ip-t␀-IŠTAR ␀-ᅣur-ša-IŠTAR-ma a-na a-l␀-ᅆi-im q␀-bi-ma,"From Hanunu, Lipit-Ištar (and) Usur-ša-Ištar to Ali-ahum:"
i-na 11 ma-na 7.5 G␀N K␀.BABBAR-p␀-k␀ ša iš-t␀ pu-ru-uš-ᅆa-dim ub-lu-ni-ni a-na ma-la t␀-ir-t␀-k␀ a-na ᅡup-p␀-k␀ ša 7.33333 ma-na 5 G␀N K␀.BABBAR ša a-na zu-ku-a ᅆa-bu-l␀-t␀-ni u₄-mu-k␀ 3 ITU.KAM i-t␀-q␀-ma,Of the 11 minas 7.5 shekels of your silver that they brought from Purušhaddum--in accordance with your instructions for your tablet concerning 7.33333 minas 5 shekels of silver which you owed to Zukuwa--your terms were exceeded by 3 months.
