KIŠIB ú-ṣur-ša-a-šùr DUMU šu-ku-bí-im,sealed by Uṣur-ša-Aššur son of Šu-Kūbum.
ni-kà-sí ma-aḫ-ri-ni i-dí-a-bu-um ù ša-lim-a-šùr i-sí-ú,Iddin-abum and Šalim-Aššur settled accounts with us as witnesses.
a-na mu-lá-a 10 ma-na KÙ.GI ší-ip-kà-at i-sú-rik₁₃ ša a-na ša-lim-a-šùr ša-ap-ku,"As compensation for 10 minas of gold, Issu-arik's investment that had been invested in Šalim-Aššur."
