2 qá-áb-li-a-tim ša 1 ma-na.TA KÙ.BABBAR,"2 qablītum-containers of 1 mina silver each,"
iš-té-et a-ḫu-úz-tum mu-šá-lá-am ša ZABAR ù ma-az-li-ki mì-ma a-nim a-na ḫu-bu-ul (d)NIN.ŠUBUR-ba-ni a-na lu-lu áp-qí-id,"one with inlay; a bronze mirror and some mazlīkum-s. All this I entrusted to Lullu for the debt of Ilabrat-bāni,"
um-ma a-na-ku-ma a-na É a-bi-a ù um-mì-a a-na mì-ma šu-um-šu ú-lá ta-tù-ar,"with the words: You shall not again claim anything from the house of my father and mother,"
