ší-ma-am ša té-pu-šu a-na a-lim(ki) ṭá-ba-tum-ma šé-bi-lam,"Be so kind as to send the purchase you made to the City,"
a-ḫi a-ta ú a-na-ku ga-ma-al-kà,for you are my brother and I can do you favors.
