ṭup-pá-am ša ḫu-bu-ul IŠTAR-lá-ma-sí ù ma-nu-ki-ì-lí-a DUMU-i-ša i qá-qá-ad šál-mì-šu-nu ḫi-,"Write a debt-note for Ištar-lamassī and Mannum-kī-iliya, her son, certify it with joint liability, and give the tablet to my maid so it may remain in her possession until I come."
a-na ku-ni-lim qí-bi₄-ma um-ma a-mur-a-šur-ma,"Say to Kūn-ilum, thus Amur-Aššur:"
